{"spoiler":false,"text":"家出中の女子学生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"クールでサバサバした性格で、同年代の少女よりも少し大人びている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"素っ気ない態度を見せたかと思えば、悪戯っぽくからかってくるなどの茶目っ気もあり、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"懐くととことん懐くなど、どこか野良猫を想わせる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"家事は一通りできて、特に料理が得意。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"よく公園でスケッチをしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"イラストレーターになる夢を持っているけど、絵は下手くそ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"エッチ未経験。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「なんとなくね…景さんは私と近い気がしたから」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"62964"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3b/3b1b6b9ad0b7ad75f46bb4b5b13f735f89f62c8fa9cd10e6976e0f82eb6e02c0.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/58/58c9d31d98cfd258f76482c8d27b73db5ffb885b416fb3e8431dcb50fb9e8c08.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"さいとうよしえ","creatorId":"vndb:s1545","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1545","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1545","name":"さいとう よしえ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:237277:62964:20696:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c67937","characterName":"美竹 ゆうか","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"62965","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"237277"}],"egsCharacterIds":["19506"],"vndbCharacterId":"c67937"},"originalCharacterName":"美竹 ゆうか","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A girl who often wanders around Shinjuku. Underneath her gentle and goddess-like outlook she is a bit shady. For some reason, she dropped out of high school, despite being good at studying."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Due to past events she only trusts the protagonist and often keeps in contact with him."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c67937"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"新宿を徘徊している少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ふわっとした笑顔と柔らかな物腰を絶やさない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ころころと変化する甘い表情は、まるで女神のようだが、したたかな面もある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"勉強ができ、要領もいいため、だいたいのことはそつなくこなす。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"けれど、とある理由により学園を中退している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"過去の出来事がきっかけで、主人公にだけは信頼を寄せていて、度々連絡してくる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"19506","sourceWorkId":"26537","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"新宿を徘徊している少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ふわっとした笑顔と柔らかな物腰を絶やさない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ころころと変化する甘い表情は、まるで女神のようだが、したたかな面もある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"勉強ができ、要領もいいため、だいたいのことはそつなくこなす。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"けれど、とある理由により学園を中退している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"過去の出来事がきっかけで、主人公にだけは信頼を寄せていて、度々連絡してくる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「景くんは今でも、私の神さまなんだ」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"62965"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/70/70b2d66d6d73fb44fc3b075916fad72d6c93a715f3b4b3518d919f4734eb7520.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9c/9c99474d52429302c82667526738ec010a17ac87f89db7075b1fe3f05f79a17e.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"大久保藍子","creatorId":"vndb:s361","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s361","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s361","name":"大久保 藍子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:237277:62965:5075:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c69258","characterName":"八條 景","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c69258"},"originalCharacterName":"八條 景","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segmen